      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littlerock%2C_Washington",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1909 Littlerock boasted two shingle mills employing 330 workers and producing 20,000 feet of lumber daily.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littlerock%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Rutledge’s homestead earned Centennial Farm status in 1989 and sits on the Thurston County Historic Register.",
